     A          R HTLIST
     A                                  1  2'Help - To-do list'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Your to-do list.  [X] marks a fini-
     A                                      shed task.  The letter is the prior-
     A                                      ity:'
     A                                  4  3'H high, M medium, L low.  Finished-
     A                                       tasks are blue, overdue ones red.'
     A                                  5  3'The progress bar shows how much of-
     A                                       the list is done.'
     A                                  7  3'Options: 2 marks a task done, 9 re-
     A                                      opens it, 4 deletes it.'
     A                                  8  3'Cursor on a task and Enter marks i-
     A                                      t done.'
     A                                 10  3'F6 adds a task.  F9 prints the lis-
     A                                      t.  F11 removes every finished task-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 11  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HTADD
     A                                  1  2'Help - Add a task'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Type what needs doing.  The due da-
     A                                      te and priority are optional.'
     A                                  5  3'Due date: month/day, such as 3/15,-
     A                                       or month/day/year.'
     A                                  6  3'Priority: H, M or L.  Anything els-
     A                                      e is taken as M.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
